{"parse":{"title":"Wood Structures","pageid":5211,"revid":47957,"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Wood structures</b> are the first set of structures available to the player, requiring <a href=\"/wiki/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">wood</a> and the proximity of a <a href=\"/wiki/Workbench\" title=\"Workbench\">workbench</a> to be built and repaired.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Common_properties\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Common properties</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Structures\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Structures</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Floors_and_stairs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Floors and stairs</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Walls\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Walls</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Poles_and_beams\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Poles and beams</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Doors\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Doors</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Common_properties\">Common properties</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FWood_Structures%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Wood structures share the following properties:\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible\">\n<caption>Common properties\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Property</th>\n<th>Value\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Durability</td>\n<td>400\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Building_Stability\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Building Stability\">Support</a></td>\n<td>Wood (from 10 to 100)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Building_Stability\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Building Stability\">Loss</a></td>\n<td>1/8 vertical, 1/5 horizontal\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">Resistances</a></td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>Weak: <a href=\"/wiki/Chop\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Chop\">Chop</a></li>\n<li>Neutral: <a href=\"/wiki/Blunt\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Blunt\">Blunt</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Slash\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Slash\">Slash</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Pickaxe\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Pickaxe\">Pickaxe</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fire\">Fire</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Frost\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Frost\">Frost</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lightning\">Lightning</a></li>\n<li>Resistant: <a href=\"/wiki/Pierce\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Pierce\">Pierce</a></li>\n<li>Immune: <a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\">Poison</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Spirit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spirit\">Spirit</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The 2m beam, 26° beam and 45° beam are an exception and use the resistances of <a href=\"/wiki/Stone_structures\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stone structures\">stone structures</a>. This is not the case for the 1m beam.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Structures\">Structures</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FWood_Structures%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Floors_and_stairs\">Floors and stairs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FWood_Structures%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Structure</th>\n<th>Materials</th>\n<th>Size</th>\n<th>Damaged by rain\n</th>\n</tr></tbody><caption>Structures\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/6/6a/Wood_Floor_1x1.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132135\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Wood Floor 1x1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/6/6a/Wood_Floor_1x1.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132135\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"57\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Wood Floor 1x1.png\" data-image-key=\"Wood_Floor_1x1.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>&#160;Wood floor 1x1</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a> x1</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>1x0.13x1</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/9/90/Wood_Floor_2x2.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132134\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Wood Floor 2x2\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/9/90/Wood_Floor_2x2.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132134\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Wood Floor 2x2.png\" data-image-key=\"Wood_Floor_2x2.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>&#160;Wood floor 2x2</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a> x2</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>2x0.13x2</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/e/e8/Wood_Stair.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132154\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Wood Stair\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/e/e8/Wood_Stair.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132154\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Wood Stair.png\" data-image-key=\"Wood_Stair.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>&#160;Wood stair</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a> x2</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>2x2x1\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/d/d2/Wood_Ladder.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132137\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Wood Ladder\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Wood Ladder.png\" data-image-key=\"Wood_Ladder.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/d/d2/Wood_Ladder.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132137\" /></a></span>&#160;Wood ladder</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a> x2</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>1x2x2</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Walls\">Walls</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FWood_Structures%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Structure</th>\n<th>Materials</th>\n<th>Size</th>\n<th>Damaged by rain\n</th>\n</tr></tbody><caption>Structures\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/3/39/Wood_Wall_1x1.png/revision/latest?cb=20221015162107\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Wood Wall 1x1\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Wood Wall 1x1.png\" data-image-key=\"Wood_Wall_1x1.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/3/39/Wood_Wall_1x1.png/revision/latest?cb=20221015162107\" /></a></span>&#160;Wood wall 1x1</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a> x1</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>1x1x0.3\n</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/b/b9/Wood_Wall_Half.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132156\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Wood Wall Half\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Wood Wall Half.png\" data-image-key=\"Wood_Wall_Half.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/b/b9/Wood_Wall_Half.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132156\" /></a></span>&#160;Wood wall half</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a> x1</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>2x1x0.3</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/f/f5/Wood_Wall.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132155\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Wood Wall\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Wood Wall.png\" data-image-key=\"Wood_Wall.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/f/f5/Wood_Wall.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132155\" /></a></span>&#160;Wood wall</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a> x2</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>2x2x0.3</td>\n<td>Yes\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/c/cc/Wood_Wall_26%C2%B0.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132157\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Wood Wall 26°\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Wood Wall 26°.png\" data-image-key=\"Wood_Wall_26%C2%B0.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/c/cc/Wood_Wall_26%C2%B0.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132157\" /></a></span>&#160;Wood wall 26°</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a> x2</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>2x1</td>\n<td>No\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/f/f9/Wood_Wall_26%C2%B0_%28Inverted%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20221015174114\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Wood Wall 26° (Inverted)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Wood Wall 26° (Inverted).png\" data-image-key=\"Wood_Wall_26%C2%B0_%28Inverted%29.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/f/f9/Wood_Wall_26%C2%B0_%28Inverted%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20221015174114\" /></a></span>&#160;Wood wall 26° (inverted)</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a> x2</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>2x1</td>\n<td>No\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/7/72/Wood_Roof_Cross_26%C2%B0.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132159\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Wood Roof Cross 26°\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Wood Roof Cross 26°.png\" data-image-key=\"Wood_Roof_Cross_26%C2%B0.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/7/72/Wood_Roof_Cross_26%C2%B0.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132159\" /></a></span>&#160;Wood roof cross 26°</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a> x2</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>2x1</td>\n<td>No\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/b/b2/Wood_Wall_45%C2%B0.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132158\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Wood Wall 45°\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Wood Wall 45°.png\" data-image-key=\"Wood_Wall_45%C2%B0.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/b/b2/Wood_Wall_45%C2%B0.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215132158\" /></a></span>&#160;Wood wall 45°</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a> x2</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>2x2</td>\n<td>No\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/1/16/Wood_Wall_45%C2%B0_%28Inverted%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20221015182227\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Wood Wall 45° (Inverted)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\